    "summary": "Bearer: an **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** model.\n\nWhenever the bearer gets **selected to fight**, once it has resolved its attacks, if they **destroyed** any enemy units, you can activate this Enhancement for it. Doing so makes the Enhancement expended: pick an enemy unit not in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of any unit of yours, up to 12\" from the bearer and **visible** to it, and roll 6D6. That enemy unit takes a [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) for each 4+.",
